      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785267458972,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Lancement (cold start) :   W1 = 0.95,  W2 = 0.05      (le graphe est quasi vide)\nApres 1000 interactions :  W1 = 0.60,  W2 = 0.40      (intelligence collective active)\nRegime etabli :            W1 = 0.50,  W2 = 0.50      (equilibre optimal)",
      "originalText": "Lancement (cold start) :   W1 = 0.95,  W2 = 0.05      (le graphe est quasi vide)\nApres 1000 interactions :  W1 = 0.60,  W2 = 0.40      (intelligence collective active)\nRegime etabli :            W1 = 0.50,  W2 = 0.50      (equilibre optimal)",
