      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785276696731,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cos(\u03b8) = \u03a3(A_i * B_i) / (\u221a\u03a3(A_i\u00b2) * \u221a\u03a3(B_i\u00b2))",
      "originalText": "Cos(\u03b8) = \u03a3(A_i * B_i) / (\u221a\u03a3(A_i\u00b2) * \u221a\u03a3(B_i\u00b2))",
