      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785276696732,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Calcul du Score Collaboratif :\nYoussef (m\u00eame segment) a SAUVEGARD\u00c9 (w=3)\nle Lodgy il y a 2 jours (recency=0.95).\n\nAmina (m\u00eame segment) a VU (w=1)\nle Lodgy aujourd'hui (recency=1.0).\n\n\u03a3 = (3 * 0.95) + (1 * 1.0) = 3.85",
      "originalText": "Calcul du Score Collaboratif :\nYoussef (m\u00eame segment) a SAUVEGARD\u00c9 (w=3)\nle Lodgy il y a 2 jours (recency=0.95).\n\nAmina (m\u00eame segment) a VU (w=1)\nle Lodgy aujourd'hui (recency=1.0).\n\n\u03a3 = (3 * 0.95) + (1 * 1.0) = 3.85",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
